        <h1>Why a Clean-Looking Hood Can Still Hide Grease</h1>

        <p>
          A shiny hood can make your kitchen look well maintained.
          But the outside finish tells only part of the story.
          Behind the filters and inside the hood, grease may remain
          in places that routine surface wiping does not reach.
        </p>

        <p class="byline">
          By Best Commercial Hood Cleaning
        </p>

        <div class="buttons">
          <a class="btn" href="tel:+16462016351">
            Call 646-201-6351
          </a>

          <a class="btn secondary" href="sms:+16462016351">
