          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="article-content">

        <div class="summary-box">
          <p>
            <strong>The key point:</strong>
            A clean exterior does not confirm that the inside of your
            hood and exhaust system is clean. Ask what areas were
            actually inspected and cleaned—not just whether the
            stainless steel was polished.
          </p>
        </div>

        <aside class="contents" aria-label="Article contents">
          <h2>In this guide</h2>

          <ul>
            <li><a href="#surface">Surface cleaning versus internal cleaning</a></li>
            <li><a href="#hidden-areas">Where grease can remain</a></li>
            <li><a href="#signs">Changes worth reporting</a></li>
            <li><a href="#scope">Questions to ask before booking</a></li>
